# CODEOWNERS for xfalcon-desktop
#
# This file names reviewers for security-critical paths. It takes effect only
# when branch protection on `staging` and `main` requires review from Code
# Owners. That setting is owned by the IT team on GitHub; this file alone does
# not enforce anything.
#
# Owners listed here are the repository admins. IT should replace them with a
# team handle once a team with write access exists.
#
# Rules: one pattern per line, followed by owners. The LAST matching pattern
# wins. Patterns follow .gitignore rules, and a leading "/" anchors a pattern
# to the repository root.

